    "key_features_cYqADq": {
      "type": "key-features",
      "blocks": {
        "feature_8xNxtg": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Diamond_Rough.jpg",
            "bg_color": "#e3e3e3",
            "bg_gradient": "",
            "text_color": "#505050",
            "heading": "NATURAL DIAMONDS",
            "text": "<p>Natural diamonds are formed deep within the Earth's mantle over millions to billions of years under high pressure and temperature conditions. They are the most common type of  diamonds found in nature and are prized for their beauty, rarity, and durability. Natural diamonds generally form in a tetrahedron shape.</p>",
            "show_segments": false,
            "segments": 4,
            "active_segment": "4",
            "fill_segments": true,
            "show_labels": true,
            "label_left": "",
            "label_middle": "",
            "label_right": "",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon": "star"
          }
        },
        "feature_XTPAHm": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Large_synthetic_diamond.png",
            "bg_color": "#e3e3e3",
            "bg_gradient": "",
            "text_color": "#505050",
            "heading": "LAB-GROWN DIAMONDS",
            "text": "<p>Lab-Grown Diamonds, also known as lab-created or<br/>synthetic diamonds, are produced in a controlled laboratory setting using advanced technology that replicates the natural diamond-growing process. These diamonds have the same chemical composition, physical properties, and optical characteristics as natural diamonds but are typically more affordable.</p>",
            "show_segments": false,
            "segments": 5,
            "active_segment": "4",
            "fill_segments": true,
            "show_labels": true,
            "label_left": "",
            "label_middle": "",
            "label_right": "",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon": "star"
          }
        },
        "feature_WcHe8J": {
          "type": "feature",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "bg_color": "#e3e3e3",
            "bg_gradient": "",
            "text_color": "#505050",
            "heading": "TREATED DIAMONDS",
            "text": "<p>Treated diamonds are natural or synthetic diamonds that have undergone enhancement treatments to improve their color, clarity, or overall appearance. Common treatments include laser drilling to remove inclusions, fracture filling to improve clarity, and high-pressure, high-temperature (HPHT) and chemical vapor deposition (CVD) processes to alter the diamond's color.</p>",
            "show_segments": false,
            "segments": 4,
            "active_segment": "4",
            "fill_segments": true,
            "show_labels": true,
            "label_left": "",
            "label_middle": "",
            "label_right": "",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon": "star"
          }
        },
        "feature_fmahzy": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/5512352220_6d6fef8a1b_o.jpg",
            "bg_color": "#e3e3e3",
            "bg_gradient": "",
            "text_color": "#505050",
            "heading": "FANCY COLOR DIAMONDS",
            "text": "<p>Fancy color diamonds are natural or synthetic diamonds<br/>that exhibit intense and distinct colors, such as yellow, blue, pink, red, green, and black. These diamonds are rare and highly valued for their unique and vibrant hues. The color intensity and distribution within the diamond determine its value, with vivid and evenly distributed colors commanding higher prices.</p>",
            "show_segments": false,
            "segments": 4,
            "active_segment": "4",
            "fill_segments": true,
            "show_labels": true,
            "label_left": "",
            "label_middle": "",
            "label_right": "",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon": "star"
          }
        }
      },
